<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - EVEREN cuts Tanger view.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - EVEREN cuts Tanger view.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- EVEREN Securities Inc said Tuesday it had cut its intermediate-term view on Tanger Factory Outlet Centers Inc to market performer from outperform.</p>
<p>-- EVEREN lowered its 1997 funds from operations view on the company to $3.28 a share from $3.32.</p>
</text>
